*   **Async Job Governance:** Background job priorities (`docs/architecture/background_jobs.md:220-260`) place archive exports in BULK and standard report exports in DEFAULT. Choose an appropriate queue for data exports vs deletion purges, emit SLA metrics, and document retries/backoff for long-running pulls.
*   **Storage & Partitions:** Platform ops guidance (`docs/architecture/platform_ops.md:44-74`) highlights R2 tenant prefixes and PostgreSQL session/audit partitions. Ensure deletion jobs clean up both hot partitions and archived blobs, and log manifest metadata for compliance checks.
*   **Error Handling:** `ProblemDetail` plus the security package conventions favor RFC 7807 responses with traceable instances. Include `trace_id`/`job_id` extensions so support teams can reconcile user-facing tickets with background job entries and audit logs.
